      "section_id": "kohler-volume-2:p0321-p0324:s00:x00",
      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "                                              Quassia amara L.\n                     Quassiastrauch, Bitterholz —                   Bois amer —             Bitter wood.\n          Familie: Simarubaceae; Gattung: Quassia L.",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "苦木科苦木屬，學名 Quassia amara L.，俗稱苦木或苦樹。",
      "evidence_indexes": [
        0
      ],
      "source_locator": {
